abstract: "ALPS-4B (Adaptive Latent Prediction System, Four-Brain) is a multi-scale, temporally decoupled Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture (JEPA) incorporating spatiotemporal tube masking, Banach checker convergence proofs, and out-of-gradient safety watchdogs for lifelong learning and system integrity."

